  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Mostly a request for desktop users, but if possible, the ability to navigate the VRChat menu using the arrow and Enter keys would be a nice option.\n\nIn particular, I think this would be useful in instances where the desktop user is experiencing a severe framerate drop that hinders them from navigating the menu accurately with the mouse: keyboard navigation would allow desktop users to change avatars or hit their Homeworld button much more easily than pointing at it with the mouse.\n\nOn a related note: having a keyboard shortcut for returning to your homeworld might also be good (unless it's already implemented), but I'd personally imagine the keyboard navigation option to be more useful overall.",
